{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bAkm957K4q1792664077.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>周大福發盈喜。</p><p></p><p>預期截至9月底止上半年度溢利，按年增長約九成至1倍。主要由於黃金借貸合約，由去年同期的重估虧損，轉為錄得重估收益，以及核心市場的銷售改善所致。集團中期業績將在11月底前公布。</p><p></p><p>另外，集團截至9月底止第二季度，整體零售值按年下跌百分之0.5，當中，內地下跌逾半成，香港澳門及其他市場，則增長三成三。</p><p></p><p>同店銷售表現，香港和澳門分別增長兩成四及四成七，內地直營店同店銷售增長百分之2.2，內地加盟店則下跌百分之2.9。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:04.143672+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:44.280477+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:43.366206+00:00","content_hash":"fa7d947c081aea77a2e02a41b955c63f767091a88ecc379b5392140592bdd3f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:04.143672+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}